{"title":"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13a96240c51d61ba3733d9f5c3020fa92ec4136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> be a convex pentagon such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/428c91b22a0b601edfc1005416ebbe55660a9f3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />. Assume that there is a\npoint <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> inside <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13a96240c51d61ba3733d9f5c3020fa92ec4136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/3/01386c549dd8616da35b663db9279e962cc96872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TB = TD$\" width=\"80\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aebe5e56eacd13282aceb5ba012fc454212dd5c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TC = TE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/f/13fc13991ae8c55cea21c24c36d52524515435dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABT = \\angle TEA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"134\" height=\"14\" />. Let line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> intersect\nlines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/beeb8b6e592416cc65ddbca9ccd35999c615d398.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CT$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, respectively. Assume that the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c199367bcd230fa00311e658a67f08848090f56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P, B, A, Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" /> occur on their\nline in that order. Let line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> intersect lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/6/c46732cc54ebf7b9abd5412d340937bc62972493.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DT$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. Assume\nthat the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/4/c3456bc9c56c29f61b3f8c5a1603f7f3cdda09d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R, E, A, S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> occur on their line in that order. Prove that the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e1e9e8c101f8e1ee4ae2470407b6d49d7fa96ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P, S, Q, R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" /> lie on\na circle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-AII0ldyDww\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-AII0ldyDww</a> [Video contains solutions to all day 2 problems]\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WpM0mLyPyLg?si=yi9AZPVdYSPMCcHa\">https://youtu.be/WpM0mLyPyLg?si=yi9AZPVdYSPMCcHa</a>\n[Video Solution by little fermat]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2022_IMO_4.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/56/2022_IMO_4.png/400px-2022_IMO_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"387\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/56/2022_IMO_4.png/600px-2022_IMO_4.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/5/56/2022_IMO_4.png 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68ea05a51c9d42db04e1b0c91ba34921b99c0e64.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[TB = TD, TC = TE, BC = DE \\implies\\]\" width=\"298\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf211f5bde0286c839829cbfb266b0b7a47fa30a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\triangle TBC = \\triangle TDE \\implies \\angle BTC = \\angle DTE.\\]\" width=\"329\" height=\"13\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/096cb624ceca29c46fe7e23a28a6bb00ce4eac2f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle BTQ = 180^\\circ - \\angle BTC = 180^\\circ - \\angle DTE = \\angle STE\\]\" width=\"405\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/0/780a0ed94981f46136ac44ee6df9e53324cdbb60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle ABT = \\angle AET \\implies  \\triangle TQB \\sim \\triangle TSE \\implies\\]\" width=\"359\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55f09ddeed3125faac91f8e3d560ec4413ba2110.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle PQC = \\angle EST, \\hspace{18mm}\\frac {QT}{ST}= \\frac {TB}{TE} \\implies\\]\" width=\"350\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26f2357e000386f6a255dc86fb6599f9cb4e1f64.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[QT \\cdot TE =QT \\cdot TC = ST \\cdot TB= ST \\cdot TD \\implies\\]\" width=\"380\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/0/e906ebd1d891ee7ee2d6c1326dc0a507b6ceb4c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{28mm}CDQS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"191\" height=\"18\" /> is cyclic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d47504f270d951f9e87209729bb16f41287f3c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\angle QCD = \\angle QSD.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"188\" height=\"18\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4f432c1d2d16eabfca2a95129fd6cb99d3048bf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle QPR =\\angle QPC = \\angle QCD - \\angle PQC =\\]\" width=\"312\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/8/b2849a1f2ea4cb7b3b5de500ebc5877020932735.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle QSD - \\angle EST =  \\angle QSR \\implies\\]\" width=\"245\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d7302093585554367905d197d813b462553cbd28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{43mm}PRQS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"260\" height=\"18\" /> is cyclic.\n</p><p><b>vladimir.shelomovskii@gmail.com, vvsss</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO\" title=\"2022 IMO\">2022 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018021829\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nR